  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now, world categories seems to be heavily biased towards popular but very basic worlds (e.g. The box and sleeping maps). There is a 'Games' category which is nice and 'Spotlight', but this category seems to heavily favor creators who have close ties with the VRChat devs, definitely not community based. 'Community Labs' just filters out non-popular worlds, it doesn't help much with world discovery.\n\nIt would be nice to have categories for more world categories such as exploration, hangout, educational etc. as there are so many awesome worlds that go unnoticed. This would help motivate world creators and make it easier for people to find new, interesting worlds.",
